  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng shouts, and golden light bursts out like a sun, too bright to look at. Vast radiation fills the world and the temperature rises as if the world is getting roasted. Lang Ya land spirit is not afraid of soul burning, but once this move is used Qin Bai Sheng turns into a miniature sun and shines as if he became the ruler of the world. Lang Ya land spirit’s attacks are disrupted or resisted. Burning soul supreme gold becomes the turning point of the battle. Qin Bai Sheng regains the initiative and does not hand it over again.",
